{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38862","headline":"山居寄同志 · 杜荀鹤","name":"山居寄同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅斋深僻绝轮蹄，门径缘莎细接溪。\n垂钓石台依竹垒，待宾茶竈就岩泥。\n风生谷口猿相叫，月照松头鹤竝栖。\n不是无端过时日，拟从窗下蹑云梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}